                            <div class="news-text">
                                <p>RomArchive wins Grimme Online Award 2020</p>
                                <p>On June 25,
                                    2020, RomArchive won the prestigious Grimme Online Award 2020 in the
                                    category "Knowledge and Education". This award honors educational
                                    programs that provide content relevant to the general public and serve
                                    to educate, advise and inform society.</p>
                            </div>
